# Replai UI — taste-skill

Before changing any visual UI, read `DESIGN.md` and follow `.cursor/skills/design-taste-frontend`.

**Design read (locked):** premium consumer messaging PWA, Soft Structuralism, white + blue, Apple-y iOS bridge.

## Must follow
- Outfit + Geist Mono only (no Inter)
- Brand blue accent only — no purple gradients
- `min-h-[100dvh]`, safe-area utilities on app chrome
- Motion: spring / `cubic-bezier(0.32, 0.72, 0, 1)`, transform+opacity only
- Floating island nav on marketing; iMessage chrome in chat
- Double-bezel phone mockups; squircle avatars
- Sentence case headlines; no AI copy clichés (elevate, unleash, seamless…)
